# Who is asked to review a pull request here.
#
# Everything, one rule. Most of what lands in this repository now arrives from
# voiceatcsimulator.com/contribute, opened by the website's GitHub App on behalf
# of someone who has no GitHub account and is watching their contributions page
# instead. Nobody would be notified of those at all without this file.
#
# It covers hand-written pull requests too, deliberately. A maintainer's own
# pull request notifies the other two — GitHub never requests review from the
# author — which is the review that used to depend on someone remembering to ask.
#
# Individual logins, not a team: this repository belongs to a user account, and
# user accounts have no teams to name.
#
# The website also sets these three as Assignees. That is a separate field and a
# separate permission; if it ever stops working, the review request made here is
# unaffected.

